  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of training &quot;Introduction to Humanitarian Scenario&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of this project is to design and test a two-days face-to-face training module about humanitarian scenario analysis.  The aim is to provide a introduction to humanitarian scenario, their purpose, content and use for IFRC and National Societies decision-makers, information manager and humanitarian analysts.</narrative>
  </description>
